Swing mode: an anchor sits at a bar's average price. The price must run at
least X but at most Y pips to one side of the anchor (the largest excursion
so far is P), then turn and run 2*P the other way, i.e. touch anchor-P after
a move up or anchor+P after a move down. That touch enters ONE trade at that
exact level, in the direction of the turn, SL and TP from the entry level.
